<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
<meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow" />
<title>Jedox Brand Idea — Ron Dimon</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Baloo+2:wght@500;600;700;800&family=Open+Sans:ital,wght@0,400;0,600;0,700;1,600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
<style>
  :root {
    --navy-dark: #16223c;
    --navy: #20355f;
    --purple: #4a2f6f;
    --pink: #ed1979;
    --white: #ffffff;
    --item-h: 1.3em;   /* height of one row in the scrolling lists */
    --rows: 5;         /* how many rows are visible at once */
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  html, body { height: 100%; }
  body {
    font-family: 'Open Sans', Arial, sans-serif;
    background: linear-gradient(160deg, var(--navy-dark) 0%, var(--navy) 45%, var(--purple) 100%);
    color: var(--white);
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    overflow-x: hidden;
  }

  header {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 48px 24px 0;
  }
  .eyebrow {
    display: inline-block;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    letter-spacing: 2.5px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--pink);
    background: rgba(237, 25, 121, 0.12);
    border: 1px solid rgba(237, 25, 121, 0.4);
    border-radius: 999px;
    padding: 6px 18px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  h1 {
    font-family: 'Baloo 2', 'Open Sans', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: clamp(1.35rem, 2.4vw, 2rem);
    line-height: 1.25;
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .subhead {
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 16px auto 0;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.75);
  }

  /* ---- The centered one-line equation ---- */
  main.hero {
    flex: 1;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 24px 20px;
  }

  .equation {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: nowrap;
    align-items: center;      /* centre row of each list lines up with the sentence */
    justify-content: center;
    white-space: nowrap;
    font-family: 'Baloo 2', 'Open Sans', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 2.4vw, 2.2rem);
    line-height: var(--item-h);
  }

  .static-text { color: var(--white); }

  /* Scroll windows: several rows tall, faded top and bottom so the
     middle row reads as the "live" one while the rest glide past. */
  .scroll-window {
    display: block;
    overflow: hidden;
    height: calc(var(--item-h) * var(--rows));
    -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom,
      transparent 0%, rgba(0,0,0,0.35) 14%, #000 40%, #000 60%, rgba(0,0,0,0.35) 86%, transparent 100%);
    mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom,
      transparent 0%, rgba(0,0,0,0.35) 14%, #000 40%, #000 60%, rgba(0,0,0,0.35) 86%, transparent 100%);
  }
  .scroll-track { display: block; }
  .scroll-track > span {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    height: var(--item-h);
    line-height: var(--item-h);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  /* Each track holds the list twice, so translating up by exactly half
     its height lands back on an identical frame — a seamless loop. */
  @keyframes scrollList {
    from { transform: translateY(0); }
    to   { transform: translateY(-50%); }
  }

  /* J-word list — right-aligned so the gap before "Enterprise" never moves */
  .word-scroll { margin-right: 0.34em; }
  .word-scroll .scroll-track > span {
    color: var(--pink);
    justify-content: flex-end;
  }
  .word-scroll .scroll-track {
    animation: scrollList 21s linear infinite;   /* 7 items × 3s */
  }

  .x-mark {
    height: 0.92em;
    width: auto;
    margin-left: 0.3em;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  /* X= list — same face, size and weight as the sentence, in white */
  .phrase-scroll { margin-left: 0.55em; }
  .phrase-scroll .scroll-track > span {
    color: var(--white);
    justify-content: flex-start;
  }
  .phrase-scroll .scroll-track {
    animation: scrollList 45s linear infinite;   /* 15 items × 3s */
  }

  footer {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 24px 24px 32px;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5);
  }
  footer a { color: var(--pink); text-decoration: none; }
  footer a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }

  /* Narrow screens: fewer rows, wrap the X= list onto its own centred line */
  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    :root { --rows: 3; }
    .equation {
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      font-size: 1.45rem;
    }
    .word-scroll .scroll-track > span { justify-content: center; }
    .phrase-scroll {
      flex-basis: 100%;
      margin-left: 0;
      margin-top: 0.4em;
    }
    .phrase-scroll .scroll-track > span { justify-content: center; }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .scroll-track { animation: none !important; }
    .scroll-window {
      height: var(--item-h);
      -webkit-mask-image: none;
      mask-image: none;
    }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <p class="eyebrow">Brand Concept</p>
  <h1>Jedox brand idea by Ron Dimon of sparklabs.studio</h1>
  <p class="subhead">
    Every enterprise decision is really a question about an unknown — X. This page turns that thought into a live brand device: a single sentence whose opening word and closing variable keep rotating, so the line can be read hundreds of ways. Watch it long enough and it tells you what Jedox is actually for.
  </p>
</header>

<main class="hero">
  <div class="equation">

    <span class="scroll-window word-scroll">
      <span class="scroll-track">
        <span>Jedox</span>
        <span>Joint</span>
        <span>Jedi</span>
        <span>Justified</span>
        <span>Jazzy</span>
        <span>Just-in-time</span>
        <span>Jammin&rsquo;</span>
        <span aria-hidden="true">Jedox</span>
        <span aria-hidden="true">Joint</span>
        <span aria-hidden="true">Jedi</span>
        <span aria-hidden="true">Justified</span>
        <span aria-hidden="true">Jazzy</span>
        <span aria-hidden="true">Just-in-time</span>
        <span aria-hidden="true">Jammin&rsquo;</span>
      </span>
    </span>

    <span class="static-text">Enterprise Decisions on</span>

    <img class="x-mark" src="/images/design/jedox-x-mark-pink.png" alt="X." />

    <span class="scroll-window phrase-scroll">
      <span class="scroll-track">
        <span>X=Investments</span>
        <span>X=Growth</span>
        <span>X=Headwinds</span>
        <span>X=Competition</span>
        <span>X=Pricing</span>
        <span>X=M&amp;A</span>
        <span>X=Operational Efficiency</span>
        <span>X=Profitability</span>
        <span>X=Channels</span>
        <span>X=Markets</span>
        <span>X=Cash Cycle</span>
        <span>X=Asset Utilization</span>
        <span>X=ESG</span>
        <span>X=Workforce</span>
        <span>X=Revenue Ops</span>
        <span aria-hidden="true">X=Investments</span>
        <span aria-hidden="true">X=Growth</span>
        <span aria-hidden="true">X=Headwinds</span>
        <span aria-hidden="true">X=Competition</span>
        <span aria-hidden="true">X=Pricing</span>
        <span aria-hidden="true">X=M&amp;A</span>
        <span aria-hidden="true">X=Operational Efficiency</span>
        <span aria-hidden="true">X=Profitability</span>
        <span aria-hidden="true">X=Channels</span>
        <span aria-hidden="true">X=Markets</span>
        <span aria-hidden="true">X=Cash Cycle</span>
        <span aria-hidden="true">X=Asset Utilization</span>
        <span aria-hidden="true">X=ESG</span>
        <span aria-hidden="true">X=Workforce</span>
        <span aria-hidden="true">X=Revenue Ops</span>
      </span>
    </span>

  </div>
</main>

<footer>
  <p>A brand concept by Ron Dimon &middot; <a href="https://sparklabs.studio" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">sparklabs.studio</a> &middot; not an official Jedox property</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
